{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212490","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212490","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121249001:0":{"text":"So you're here... I was afraid Aves 11 had run away again!","source_cn":"吓我一跳……原来你们跑来这里了，我还以为阿尔法十一又逃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE7B1C63872C9996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1121249001":{"text":"So you're here... I was afraid Aves 11 had run away again!","source_cn":"吓我一跳……原来你们跑来这里了，我还以为阿尔法十一又逃走了呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE7B1C63872C9996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121249002:0":{"text":"Well, Damian is still upset. I'll tell him later that the birds have been buried.","source_cn":"好吧……达米安还在生气呢，我之后会告诉他，小鸟已经被安葬了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE79A0737CD7C976F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121249003:0":{"text":"If they're buried in the soil, will they grow out of the earth again like the manafleurs?","source_cn":"只要把它们埋进土里，它们也能像魔花一样，再从土里生长出来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F82C603861FFC10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121249004:0":{"text":"No, that... just won't happen.","source_cn":"想什么呢……不可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09703C2911D95533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121249005:0":{"text":"Then what is the point of doing this?","source_cn":"这样做的意义呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD9DA1EFA0B9866B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121249006:0":{"text":"Life comes from nature. When we die, we should return to it.","source_cn":"我们的生命源于自然，死后，也应当回归自然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FB9434B30BA5B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121249007:0":{"text":"But when the living know the dead have a place they've returned to, it gives comfort.","source_cn":"但是死者有了归处，其实是生者获得慰藉。或许这就是意义吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0499C7114C6BF858","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121249008:0":{"text":"I still don't understand...","source_cn":"我还是听不懂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A0025BB8F3D8BBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121249009:0":{"text":"I promise you'll get it when you know more of who you are. Let's not think about it now. Granny Dahnie wants to see you.","source_cn":"等你知道自己的身份后，一定可以理解。现在先别想这些了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A43416679D8CB4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121249010:0":{"text":"She wants to know how you're doing after taking the medicine. Let's go see her.","source_cn":"她想知道你吃了药以后情况如何，快过去找她吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E52FE9EC51040F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"So here's what happened...","source_cn":"（向蕾米雅说明）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3774EE230F2698B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So here's what happened...","female":"So here's what happened...","variant_male_record_index":"63290","variant_female_record_index":"63291","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"Lenya","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔法十一":{"text":"Aves 11","source":"阿尔法十一","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}